p 4, local proof (ADR 0001): suites and checks from [cycle.tests] and [cycle.checks] run in a clean checkout. Their results are kept as signed lines in git notes, and git board verify checks them (#40, #46).\n▎ - Step 6, the review screen; steps 2, 5 and 7 (#47, #48).\n▎ - make ci runs everything CI runs, and a lefthook pre-commit runs gofmt, go vet and the typecheck (#41).\n▎ - Smaller changes: the assignee picker, make install-latest, the board toolbar on one line, and a forge run's progress kept in its box.\n▎ - The git-bug fork at sync.9: on organization repositories, kinds become GitHub issue types. Known: a kind swap takes two syncs (fixed in v0.10.1).\n▎ - Not yet: proofs don't travel between clones until 00f8797."}}]}